  "description": "Turn every outdoor ride into a fun adventure with this 12 inch Dino kids bike for boys and girls aged 2 to 4. Featuring an exclusive dinosaur-inspired design with cool dino graphics on the chain guard and matching decals across the frame, this mint green toddler bicycle sparks instant excitement. Built with a durable steel frame, it offers tool-free adjustable seat and handlebar heights to accommodate growing children between 32 and 41 inches tall. No more fears of tipping over or messy clothes—sturdy removable training wheels provide balance support, while a full chain guard and mudguards keep splashes away. The dual braking system combines a rear coaster foot brake with a responsive front handbrake for easy stopping power. Complete with wear-resistant rubber tires on a soft kid-sized saddle, this dinosaur bicycle is the perfect surprise gift for young beginner riders.\nEXCLUSIVE DINO DESIGN: Features cool dinosaur graphics on the chain guard and matching decals across the frame, making every neighborhood ride an exciting dino adventure.",
